{"server":"cn","storyId":"act26side_level_act26side_03_beg","groupId":"act26side","stageId":"act26side_03","title":"岂可空手回天府？","storyCode":"HE-3","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"1bf374c0798d5a9941ac3209863ee30d5e8244c4cd6e4cf72ca189ecb20cd5f1","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"福尔图娜的光环逐渐暗淡，奥伦现身修道院，与此同时，蕾缪安遭到怪影袭击。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"这是一种难以形容的感觉。\n额头上传来古怪的痒意，头顶的光环不稳定地明灭。\n眼前的一切都逐渐开始变得黯淡。\n福尔图娜能看到老迈的主教难以置信的双眼，她能听到周围嘈杂的人声。\n但当她像之前每一次那样，试图感受面前的老人的想法，对方的心情却无法再流入她的心灵，一丝一毫也不能——\n她感受不到其他萨科塔了。\n她已不再是他们之中的一员。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g7_chapel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"堕天......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么意思......福尔图娜她会怎么样？她、她是病了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个回头再解释，先处理眼下最要紧的问题——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯特凡诺爷爷......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救救菲娜！求您了，快、快救救她......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，不要慌，好好说......到底是怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲娜、菲娜流了好多血，我怎么也止不住......我找不到人帮忙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是、只是吵了一架，菲娜要我的守护铳，我该给她的，我为什么不给她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是我不好......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别怕，别怕，孩子，别害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从现有的情况判断，我认为这是一场不包含主观加害意图的意外伤害事件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"住口！执行者！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在指控这个孩子......伤害了她的同胞？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你竟敢做出这种指控——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是最合理的推测。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戒律带来的排斥并非无法克服，无意走火的状况更是时有发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一派胡言！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......他说得对......是我，是我扣了扳机！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"福尔图娜！可你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......斯特凡诺爷爷，是我的错，要怎么惩罚我都可以！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是菲娜还在......她受伤了！求您救救菲娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好，我现在就去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"急救我擅长，告诉我在什么地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在、就在我的房间......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以带路！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拜托你了，克莱芒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少说废话，快点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g10_monasterycorridor_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这边，请跟我来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了，就是这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"门没有关上......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g9_monasteryroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好多血......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德尔菲娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小点声！你想让所有人都知道这里出事了吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让开，让我看看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不行。伤势太严重，血止不住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且她的伤......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在该怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"花......对了！我记得主教阁下说过圣堂的花也能当药用！对，对，一定能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这就去摘！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别拦着我！立刻、立刻去的话，也许还来得及——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去了也没用！就算止住血，也来不及了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么意思？怎么会没用......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在极近距离中弹，大量失血，探查不到鼻息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我试了急救，但没什么效果，她的心跳没能恢复。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有呼吸......也没有心跳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很大可能是一击毙命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这女孩已经死了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g7_chapel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把大门关上了，好在附近没有其他人，应该没有多少目击者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在要怎么处理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等待斯普莉雅的处理结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"堕天使的光环产生色变，她堕天的速度很快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为修道院内部的稳定考虑，我的建议是：立刻取消布道，对内封锁这一消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一个提议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为避免发生不必要的冲突，接下来一段时间，由我与我的同僚接管这里的巡逻工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有居民应当尽快回到各自房间，等待明日的最终决议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可以最大限度地确保不再发生其他意外事件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......执行者阁下，在修道院的归属尚未落定前，这里还不是拉特兰的领土！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......修道院内部的问题我们自会解决，不敢劳动拉特兰的客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"执行者阁下也说了，这只是一场意外事故，德尔菲娜现在如何尚不确定，一切可能只是虚惊一场......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不论是否是意外，她已经堕天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"堕天使相关问题必须由教宗阁下与枢机团亲自判断并处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要将这孩子带回拉特兰，可我从未在拉特兰城中见过头生双角的萨科塔，从未！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，执行者阁下，这要我如何能够相信你所谓的处理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......费德里科，我稍微提醒一下，教宗阁下是不是说要你注意点，别闹出太大矛盾来着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？我没有制造矛盾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，好吧。我的意思是......嗯，你的方式可以再稍微缓和一点......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不理解你的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是感谢你的提议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......唉，算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得......在这里争论也不会有结果。既然我们暂时不会离开，不如先找个地方让这位，嗯，福尔图娜小姐稍微休息一会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等搞清楚具体情况，大家都稍微平静一些，再来商量具体的解决办法也不迟嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主教阁下也不必对拉特兰这么没有信心，类似的例子之前也不是没有过，只要确实不是恶意违反戒律，应该还是不会受太重责罚的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对吧，费德里科？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对。但这不属于你有权限透露的情报，里凯莱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特殊情况，特殊情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两位都考虑一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有意见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......斯特凡诺爷爷，别说了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我的错......不论什么样的处罚，我都会接受......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"福尔图娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟你走，这位先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就这么定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我送福尔图娜小姐去休息，两位就在这里冷静一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g9_monasteryroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的房间看起来还不错。呃......很宽敞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要太担心，你的事情比较特殊，教宗阁下应该会亲自过问。只要不是故意伤人，应该不会太严重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......菲娜她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲娜，是那位......受伤的萨科塔公民？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前还不能确定对方的状态，我的同事应该已经在处理了。往好处想，或许没有那么严重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的角......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么我会长出这样的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和萨卡兹一样的角......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个啊，其实我也不那么清楚......总之，等到了拉特兰会有人告诉你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暂时就在这里好好休息吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会待在门外，如果有什么问题，可以敲门喊我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g10_monasterycorridor_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......不知道费德里科会怎么处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道吗，其实我还是个挺敏感的人来着。如果有人鬼鬼祟祟地躲在我背后，我会忍不住流冷汗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别藏了，出来吧，奥伦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能问一句吗，你是怎么发现我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我只是想诈你一下，没想到你真的会出现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你指望我会相信这话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不呢？左右我也不亏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了吧，里凯莱，你这个骗子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么说，至少我比斯普莉雅要更诚实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯普莉雅是你那边的人对吧，她说了谎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......也不能算是说谎，她只是没有把话说全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这话从何谈起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前在问到和你有关的问题时，她只说“懒得管你”，没给出其他任何信息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在回避费德里科的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就凭这个，你就判定她说了谎？一般人不会这么想吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是因为我也挺擅长这么干。而且，看看这里的情况，很容易就能猜到你会怎么行动，我猜费德里科应该也猜到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难缠的家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我果然还是该找个时间拉他喝一杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后被他押送回教皇厅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这座修道院里的客人比你想的还要大牌得多。到时候费德里科不一定还有心思抓我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......听起来这里的麻烦真不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，奥伦，你和斯普莉雅的计划具体是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听了我的计划，你就会帮我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个嘛......不一定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这要等我先听了才能决定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g7_chapel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":true,"text":"费德里科，有个坏消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":true,"text":"呃......等会，现在你旁边有其他人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里凯莱不在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":true,"text":"谁管他在不在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我是问......那个叫福尔图娜的女孩在旁边吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不在。里凯莱已经将她送往住宿区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你有任何发现，请说。我需要确认受到攻击的公民的生理状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":true,"text":"......行，那我直说了——我们到的时候已经太迟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确认死亡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":true,"text":"确认。是铳造成的致命伤。除非真有奇迹，否则没可能起死回生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":true,"text":"对了，和我一起来的那位叫克莱芒的先生，他说要去摘点花，我没管他，随他去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":true,"text":"那家伙走的时候失魂落魄的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"花？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":true,"text":"就是那个资料里说的修道院特产。现在好像没剩多少了，不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":true,"text":"这件事确实是个意外，费德里科，那姑娘没说谎。铳走火。这事......或许没那么严重......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗阁下会判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":true,"text":"好吧......就连莫斯提马那样的都没事，我相信我们的教宗阁下会一如既往地宽厚仁慈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":true,"text":"一会我会联系里凯莱让他爱去哪就去哪，那姑娘我来盯着，不会让她到处乱跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":true,"text":"至于蕾缪安和奥伦那边......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥伦·亚吉奥拉斯是否已与你取得联系？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":true,"text":"......你是在怀疑我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依我判断，是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥伦的行动并没有受到限制，没有与教皇厅取得联络是他的主观行为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情牵扯到萨卡兹，我推测奥伦不会直接离开这里，如果他想要有所行动，一定会需要取得配合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":true,"text":"所以你怀疑到我头上......但里凯莱呢？你不怀疑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里凯莱单独行动的时间没有你充足。他的嫌疑程度在你之下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":true,"text":"哈哈哈，你真聪明，费德里科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我的回答是：拒绝回答。这些都是你自己猜的，我可什么都没说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":true,"text":"那就这样，回头再联系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":true,"text":"哦对了，那位主教阁下在吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":true,"text":"呃......刚刚的消息要和他再说一遍吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他已经听到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......德尔菲娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须要亲自去确认。我得去......看看那孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阁下有行动的自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但斯普莉雅不会判断错误，我不推荐额外耗费时间再去确认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"初步推测奥伦·亚吉奥拉斯仍停留在此，并有所谋划。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在我需要详细了解他失踪前，于修道院内停留期间的所有行动，以及近期修道院人员往来情况，请你配合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"执行者阁下，于你而言，何为必要？你要如何区分必要与否？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你当真听不见同胞的恸哭？情感于你真就如此不值一提？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不否认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若真是如此，你不配为乐园之先驱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若你代表拉特兰......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，拉特兰不配为我所信仰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请阁下回答我的问题：奥伦在修道院内是否有异常举动？近期是否有他人在修道院内停留？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我与你已无话好说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请自便吧，执行者阁下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g9_monasteryroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看完了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么厚的一本手记，亏他真的用完了最后一页纸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"蕾缪安舒了一口气，合上面前陈旧的素色笔记本。\n女人的手指划过封皮上那些藏着一段段故事的剐蹭痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果当初......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哎呀，我在想什么呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，接下来......嗯，我也该行动起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯普莉雅他们都已经来了，可不能再拖拖拉拉下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人在外面吗？如果有事找我的话，可以直接进来没关系。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哎呀，没想到会是这样的客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，这位客人，你来得不是时候——现在没有茶水可以招待你呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
